{"content": {"associated": {"p4": [{"aid": "171654056", "attribs": {"data-aid": "171654056", "id": "p_kq4UH"}, "childHTML": {"__html": "<a class=\"cross-ref\" href=\"/study/manual/scripture-helps-old-testament/32-psalms-1-2-3-19-33-40-46?lang=eng&amp;id=p_eiRyQ-p_kdqJP#p_eiRyQ\" data-publication=\"Psalms 1–2; 8; 19–33; 40; 46\" img-ref=\"https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/b09ac01b3b6911eda808eeeeac1eed39253683f2/full/%21500%2C/0/default\">What is the “valley of the shadow of death”?</a>"}, "heading": "What is the “valley of the shadow of death”?", "href": "/study/manual/scripture-helps-old-testament/32-psalms-1-2-3-19-33-40-46?lang=eng&id=p_eiRyQ-p_kdqJP#p_eiRyQ", "html": "<div class=\"inlineRefContent\"><p class=\"scripture-title\" data-aid=\"167649633\" id=\"p_eiRyQ\"><a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/scriptures/ot/ps/23?lang=eng&amp;id=p4#p4\" data-old-href=\"../../scriptures/ot/ps/23.html?id=p4#p4\">Psalm 23:4</a></p></div>", "id": "p_kq4UH", "key": "p4", "marker": "4", "meta": {"authorName": "", "publication": "Scripture Helps: Old Testament"}, "pid": "128445908", "title": "Psalms 1–2; 8; 19–33; 40; 46", "type": "paragraphMedia"}, {"aid": "171654057", "attribs": {"data-aid": "171654057", "id": "p_avrrg"}, "childHTML": {"__html": "<a class=\"cross-ref\" href=\"/study/manual/scripture-helps-old-testament/32-psalms-1-2-3-19-33-40-46?lang=eng&amp;id=p_aaQPT-p_xr1Z7#p_aaQPT\" data-publication=\"Psalms 1–2; 8; 19–33; 40; 46\" img-ref=\"https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/b09ac01b3b6911eda808eeeeac1eed39253683f2/full/%21500%2C/0/default\">How do the Good Shepherd’s rod and staff provide comfort?</a>"}, "heading": "How do the Good Shepherd’s rod and staff provide comfort?", "href": "/study/manual/scripture-helps-old-testament/32-psalms-1-2-3-19-33-40-46?lang=eng&id=p_aaQPT-p_xr1Z7#p_aaQPT", "html": "<div class=\"inlineRefContent\"><p class=\"scripture-title\" data-aid=\"167649641\" id=\"p_aaQPT\"><a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/scriptures/ot/ps/23?lang=eng&amp;id=p4#p4\" data-old-href=\"../../scriptures/ot/ps/23.html?id=p4#p4\">Psalm 23:4</a></p></div>", "id": "p_avrrg", "key": "p4", "marker": "4", "meta": {"authorName": "", "publication": "Scripture Helps: Old Testament"}, "pid": "128445908", "title": "Psalms 1–2; 8; 19–33; 40; 46", "type": "paragraphMedia"}]}, "body": "<header>\n<p class=\"title-number\" data-aid=\"128445902\" id=\"title_number1\">Psalm 23</p>\n<p class=\"study-summary\" data-aid=\"128445903\" id=\"study_summary1\">David declares, The Lord is my shepherd.</p>\n<p class=\"intro\" data-aid=\"128445904\" id=\"intro1\">A Psalm of David.</p>\n</header>\n<div class=\"body-block\">\n<p class=\"verse\" data-aid=\"128445905\" data-eng-ref=\"23:1\" id=\"p1\"><span class=\"verse-number\">1 </span>The <span class=\"deity-name\"><span class=\"small-caps\">Lord</span></span> <span class=\"clarity-word\">is</span> my <a class=\"study-note-ref\" href=\"#note1_a\"><sup class=\"marker\" data-value=\"a\"></sup>shepherd</a>; I shall not <a class=\"study-note-ref\" href=\"#note1_b\"><sup class=\"marker\" data-value=\"b\"></sup>want</a>.</p>\n<p class=\"verse\" data-aid=\"128445906\" data-eng-ref=\"23:2\" id=\"p2\"><span class=\"verse-number\">2 </span>He maketh me to lie down in green pastures: he <a class=\"study-note-ref\" href=\"#note2_a\"><sup class=\"marker\" data-value=\"a\"></sup>leadeth</a> me beside the still waters.</p>\n<p class=\"verse\" data-aid=\"128445907\" data-eng-ref=\"23:3\" id=\"p3\"><span class=\"verse-number\">3 </span>He restoreth my soul: he leadeth me in the paths of <a class=\"study-note-ref\" href=\"#note3_a\"><sup class=\"marker\" data-value=\"a\"></sup>righteousness</a> for his <a class=\"study-note-ref\" href=\"#note3_b\"><sup class=\"marker\" data-value=\"b\"></sup>name’s</a> sake.</p>\n<p class=\"verse\" data-aid=\"128445908\" data-eng-ref=\"23:4\" id=\"p4\"><span class=\"verse-number\">4 </span>Yea, though I <a class=\"study-note-ref\" href=\"#note4_a\"><sup class=\"marker\" data-value=\"a\"></sup>walk</a> through the <a class=\"study-note-ref\" href=\"#note4_b\"><sup class=\"marker\" data-value=\"b\"></sup>valley</a> of the <a class=\"study-note-ref\" href=\"#note4_c\"><sup class=\"marker\" data-value=\"c\"></sup>shadow</a> of <a class=\"study-note-ref\" href=\"#note4_d\"><sup class=\"marker\" data-value=\"d\"></sup>death</a>, I will fear no <a class=\"study-note-ref\" href=\"#note4_e\"><sup class=\"marker\" data-value=\"e\"></sup>evil</a>: for thou <span class=\"clarity-word\">art</span> with me; thy rod and thy staff they <a class=\"study-note-ref\" href=\"#note4_f\"><sup class=\"marker\" data-value=\"f\"></sup>comfort</a> me.</p>\n<p class=\"verse\" data-aid=\"128445909\" data-eng-ref=\"23:5\" id=\"p5\"><span class=\"verse-number\">5 </span>Thou preparest a table before me in the presence of mine enemies: thou <a class=\"study-note-ref\" href=\"#note5_a\"><sup class=\"marker\" data-value=\"a\"></sup>anointest</a> my head with oil; my cup runneth over.</p>\n<p class=\"verse\" data-aid=\"128445910\" data-eng-ref=\"23:6\" id=\"p6\"><span class=\"verse-number\">6 </span>Surely <a class=\"study-note-ref\" href=\"#note6_a\"><sup class=\"marker\" data-value=\"a\"></sup>goodness</a> and mercy shall follow me all the days of my life: and I will dwell in the house of the <span class=\"deity-name\"><span class=\"small-caps\">Lord</span></span> for ever.</p>\n</div>\n<footer class=\"study-notes\">\n<ul class=\"marker\" data-type=\"chapter\">\n<li data-marker=\"23\">\n<ul class=\"marker\" data-type=\"verse\">\n<li data-marker=\"1\">\n<ul class=\"marker\" data-type=\"marker\">\n<li data-marker=\"a\" id=\"note1_a\" data-full-marker=\"1a\">\n<p data-aid=\"128445911\" id=\"note1_a_p1\"><span data-note-category=\"tg\"><a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/tg/jesus-christ-good-shepherd?lang=eng\"><small>TG</small> Jesus Christ, Good Shepherd</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/tg/shepherd?lang=eng\">Shepherd</a>.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li data-marker=\"b\" id=\"note1_b\" data-full-marker=\"1b\">\n<p data-aid=\"128445912\" id=\"note1_b_p1\"><span data-note-category=\"cross-ref\"><a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/matt/6?lang=eng&amp;id=p8#p8\">Matt. 6:8</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/philip/4?lang=eng&amp;id=p19#p19\">Philip. 4:19</a>. </span><span data-note-category=\"tg\"><a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/tg/contentment?lang=eng\"><small>TG</small> Contentment</a>.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li data-marker=\"2\">\n<ul class=\"marker\" data-type=\"marker\">\n<li data-marker=\"a\" id=\"note2_a\" data-full-marker=\"2a\">\n<p data-aid=\"128445913\" id=\"note2_a_p1\"><span data-note-category=\"tg\"><a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/tg/guidance-divine?lang=eng\"><small>TG</small> Guidance, Divine</a>.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li data-marker=\"3\">\n<ul class=\"marker\" data-type=\"marker\">\n<li data-marker=\"a\" id=\"note3_a\" data-full-marker=\"3a\">\n<p data-aid=\"128445914\" id=\"note3_a_p1\"><span data-note-category=\"tg\"><a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/tg/righteousness?lang=eng\"><small>TG</small> Righteousness</a>.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li data-marker=\"b\" id=\"note3_b\" data-full-marker=\"3b\">\n<p data-aid=\"128445915\" id=\"note3_b_p1\"><span data-note-category=\"cross-ref\"><a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/1-sam/12?lang=eng&amp;id=p22#p22\">1 Sam. 12:22</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/ps/31?lang=eng&amp;id=p3#p3\">Ps. 31:3</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/ps/109?lang=eng&amp;id=p21#p21\">109:21</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/1-jn/2?lang=eng&amp;id=p12#p12\">1 Jn. 2:12</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/1-ne/20?lang=eng&amp;id=p9#p9\">1 Ne. 20:9</a>.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li data-marker=\"4\">\n<ul class=\"marker\" data-type=\"marker\">\n<li data-marker=\"a\" id=\"note4_a\" data-full-marker=\"4a\">\n<p data-aid=\"128445916\" id=\"note4_a_p1\"><span data-note-category=\"tg\"><a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/tg/walking-with-god?lang=eng\"><small>TG</small> Walking with God</a>.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li data-marker=\"b\" id=\"note4_b\" data-full-marker=\"4b\">\n<p data-aid=\"128445917\" id=\"note4_b_p1\"><span data-note-category=\"cross-ref\"><a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/ps/138?lang=eng&amp;id=p7#p7\">Ps. 138:7</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/127?lang=eng&amp;id=p1-p2#p2\">D&amp;C 127:2 (1–2)</a>.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li data-marker=\"c\" id=\"note4_c\" data-full-marker=\"4c\">\n<p data-aid=\"128445918\" id=\"note4_c_p1\"><span data-note-category=\"cross-ref\"><a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/job/3?lang=eng&amp;id=p5#p5\">Job 3:5</a>.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li data-marker=\"d\" id=\"note4_d\" data-full-marker=\"4d\">\n<p data-aid=\"128445919\" id=\"note4_d_p1\"><span data-note-category=\"tg\"><a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/tg/death?lang=eng\"><small>TG</small> Death</a>.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li data-marker=\"e\" id=\"note4_e\" data-full-marker=\"4e\">\n<p data-aid=\"128445920\" id=\"note4_e_p1\"><span data-note-category=\"tg\"><a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/tg/evil?lang=eng\"><small>TG</small> Evil</a>.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li data-marker=\"f\" id=\"note4_f\" data-full-marker=\"4f\">\n<p data-aid=\"128445921\" id=\"note4_f_p1\"><span data-note-category=\"tg\"><a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/tg/comfort?lang=eng\"><small>TG</small> Comfort</a>.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li data-marker=\"5\">\n<ul class=\"marker\" data-type=\"marker\">\n<li data-marker=\"a\" id=\"note5_a\" data-full-marker=\"5a\">\n<p data-aid=\"128445922\" id=\"note5_a_p1\"><span data-note-category=\"tg\"><a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures